OL,5,G2000 Griff's Canadian Adventure
OL,6,     FFrom Winnipeg to Churchill, Griff
OL,7,     FRhys Jones explores the Frozen
OL,8,     FWilds of Canada's north, in
OL,9,     FManitoba. He goes dog sledding and
OL,10,     Fvisits a town with more polar
OL,11,     Fbears than people. (Ep4/6)
OL,12,G2100 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FThis episode explores the notions
OL,14,     Fof luck and chance, when a young
OL,15,     Fman is involved in a high-speed
OL,16,     Fcar crash and an 18-year-old
OL,17,     Fbreaks his leg while playing
OL,18,     Ffootball.
